==Strategy==
Thanks to the higher health enemy base, doing the LD cheese from before is a lot harder to accomplish, almost requiring heavily boosted units or endgame units like [[Awakened Naala]]. This doesn't mean doing these stages isn't any harder, though, as these five stages are still pretty easy. Like before, spamming meatshields completely walls Hanayama, meaning you can focus on the peons and bring units to clear them out like [[Pizza Cat]], [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Slime]], and [[Courier Cat]], while you chip Hanayama down with backliners like [[Ururun Cat]].

